00:14:18,260 --> 00:14:19,940
At the thumb general. Yes.

255
00:14:20,580 --> 00:14:21,880
Okay, you got it.

256
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:26,550
Success!

257
00:14:29,660 --> 00:14:32,837
I turned into a cardboard vending
machine just before she threw it.

258
00:14:32,920 --> 00:14:34,937
I won't get anywhere
near the thumb, General.

259
00:14:35,020 --> 00:14:35,850
No big.

260
00:14:35,933 --> 00:14:38,267
I factored Llamas' bad
aim into the equation.

261
00:14:41,860 --> 00:14:43,420
What the? It's Boxxo!

262
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,340
They're so beautiful.

263
00:14:54,780 --> 00:14:57,545
I wish I could watch them
with my little ribby.

264
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:08,157
Our defeat of the Thumb General
calls for a victory dance!

265
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:11,117
But that would mean crashing
and burning, so maybe not.

266
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:13,141
Luckily, I have an exit strategy.

267
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:22,020
I should be in the clear now. Huh?

268
00:15:22,340 --> 00:15:24,340
What's this weird Field feeling?

269
00:15:25,260 --> 00:15:27,420
Boxo, you did something crazy again!

270
00:15:28,600 --> 00:15:29,430
Sorry.

271
00:15:29,600 --> 00:15:32,937
Don't think I'm gonna let you off the
hook just because you're adorable.

272
00:15:33,020 --> 00:15:34,040
Oh, the bug.

273
00:15:34,260 --> 00:15:35,731
Is it vanquished or what?

274
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:42,137
Without its summoner
binding it to this world,

275
00:15:42,220 --> 00:15:44,237
that beast went back from whence it came.

276
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:45,908
Textbook monster summoning.

277
00:15:46,420 --> 00:15:50,737
That takes care of, well, the side
story, which still leaves the main plot.

278
00:15:50,820 --> 00:15:53,585
We've got to hurry and
catch up to our friends.

279
00:15:57,460 --> 00:15:58,290
Boom!

280
00:15:58,373 --> 00:16:00,017
The mythical vehicle vending machine,

281
00:16:00,100 --> 00:16:02,497
famous amongst fellow
vending machine enthusiasts.

282
00:16:02,580 --> 00:16:06,657
When the uninitiated behold its glory,
they often mistake it for a building.

283
00:16:06,740 --> 00:16:09,387
Boxo, are you going to
give us another A-car?

284
00:16:10,020 --> 00:16:12,197
Our party's gotten pretty bloated,

285
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:14,937
and the ground's not flat
like the everlasting stratum.

286
00:16:15,020 --> 00:16:17,844
I've got to take the bumpy
terrain into account.

287
00:16:18,020 --> 00:16:19,817
Hmm, which means...

288
00:16:19,900 --> 00:16:21,040
A pick-up truck!

289
00:16:26,800 --> 00:16:29,337
That A-car looks different
from the last one.

290
00:16:29,420 --> 00:16:30,538
Yeah, you're right.

291
00:16:30,740 --> 00:16:33,157
It's definitely a lot
bigger than our old one.

292
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:34,540
It's so cool!

293
00:16:34,780 --> 00:16:35,820
We like it!

294
00:16:38,980 --> 00:16:43,417
A lot of these roads are uneven, so I know
dispensing a truck was the right call.

295
00:16:43,500 --> 00:16:45,997
There's plenty of room
even with yours truly.

296
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:49,609
Since it's a foreign build, the
standard size is still huge.

297
00:16:49,740 --> 00:16:51,897
I'm really starting to
like driving this thing.

298
00:16:51,980 --> 00:16:53,686
I'm gonna go a little faster.

299
00:16:53,780 --> 00:16:56,956
It's been a pleasant drive,
but it's almost lunchtime.

300
00:16:57,040 --> 00:16:59,687
I wonder what I should
feed my friends today.

301
00:16:59,900 --> 00:17:02,100
Ooh, I know just the thing.

302
00:17:07,700 --> 00:17:10,340
My pals are in for a tasty treat.

303
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:11,710
Blammo!

304
00:17:11,793 --> 00:17:15,137
A pizza vending machine baked to
order with all the right topics.

305
00:17:15,220 --> 00:17:17,161
It's an authentic Italiano model.

306
00:17:17,580 --> 00:17:19,500
Whatever it is looks good.

307
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:22,320
It's delicious!

308
00:17:22,800 --> 00:17:24,624
Whoa, what is this crazy stuff?

309
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:26,817
You pull it apart and it gets so stretchy.

310
00:17:26,900 --> 00:17:28,017
It was such a hit.

311
00:17:28,100 --> 00:17:29,817
They ate it all in record time.

312
00:17:29,900 --> 00:17:30,857
Don't hold out on us.

313
00:17:30,940 --> 00:17:32,577
Pop out the good stuff already.

314
00:17:32,660 --> 00:17:34,917
Hmm, someone's addicted, but I only vend.

315
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:35,830
I don't judge.

316
00:17:35,913 --> 00:17:39,231
I'm so happy everyone loves my
hot and ready pizza so much.

317
00:17:40,340 --> 00:17:41,170
Weird.

318
00:17:41,253 --> 00:17:42,377
They barely touched their zah.

319
00:17:42,460 --> 00:17:43,290
Oh, snap!

320
00:17:43,373 --> 00:17:46,693
It must be too heavy for their
ancient tummies to handle.

321
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:50,230
Thank you.

322
00:17:50,440 --> 00:17:52,637
It's kind of you to
fuss over us like that.

323
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:55,637
The last thing was interesting,
but just a little too rich.

324
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:56,997
Thanks for thinking of us.

325
00:17:57,080 --> 00:18:00,680
Though I hate to waste
perfectly good food. No worries.

326
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,977
Shui, those are all
yours if you want them.

327
00:18:03,060 --> 00:18:05,717
If I'm dreaming, so we can't
till I'm done eating, okay?

328
00:18:05,800 --> 00:18:08,565
Oh, Shui, your stomach's
as bottomless as ever.

329
00:18:08,700 --> 00:18:09,641
Just to be safe,

330
00:18:09,740 --> 00:18:14,269
I'll load her up on lots of burgers and
fried chicken before we hit the road.

331
00:18:16,260 --> 00:18:19,142
Hey, Boxel, can I have
one of those fizzy drinks?

332
00:18:20,540 --> 00:18:21,370
Now what?

333
00:18:21,453 --> 00:18:23,937
We need to devise a plan
to stop the Netherlord.

334
00:18:24,020 --> 00:18:25,337
His powers are a pain in the rear.

335
00:18:25,420 --> 00:18:29,217
But with all these points, I wonder
if I could use my barrier to blow...

336
00:18:29,300 --> 00:18:33,300
Hey, my tummy's feeling a little
angry, so how about a little snack?

337
00:18:33,780 --> 00:18:38,440
I'll just wait to attack until his
tummy's angry. No, focus! Let's think.

338
00:18:38,620 --> 00:18:41,837
Of the Finger Generals, I've defeated
the thumb and the middle fingy.

339
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:44,508
Ring Finger General
Solurine switched sides.

340
00:18:44,600 --> 00:18:45,680
That just leaves.

341
00:18:45,980 --> 00:18:48,340
Boxo, I'm still starving over here!

342
00:18:49,880 --> 00:18:53,237
The diabetes-inducing
Sweetbread General... Dadnobbit!

343
00:18:53,320 --> 00:18:55,757
I mean, the last two
generals will be tough.

344
00:18:55,840 --> 00:18:59,117
The pinky general got away, and there's
no telling where the forefinger...

345
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:02,877
I need something really sweet to help
wash down all that tasty food now.

346
00:19:02,960 --> 00:19:05,477
Right, and then there's
the dreaded juice, general.

347
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:07,457
Will you stop distracting me, Shui?

348
00:19:07,540 --> 00:19:10,817
I am this close to letting Kulimi
dissect your stomach for science.

349
00:19:10,900 --> 00:19:12,841
I'm not getting any less thirsty.

350
00:19:13,520 --> 00:19:16,057
Shui's had enough sugar
to kill a grown elephant,

351
00:19:16,140 --> 00:19:18,316
so let's try a zero-calorie beverage.

352
00:19:19,220 --> 00:19:20,220
What is this?

353
00:19:20,340 --> 00:19:22,337
There's something off
about the sweetness of it.

354
00:19:22,420 --> 00:19:24,060
Tastes okay, I guess.

355
00:19:24,700 --> 00:19:28,297
She not only eats a lot, but it seems
her sense of taste is also shockingly?

356
00:19:28,380 --> 00:19:29,760
and annoyingly refined.

357
00:19:30,180 --> 00:19:33,121
You're not thinking something
rude, are you, Boxo?

358
00:19:33,600 --> 00:19:34,480
Gaining what?

359
00:19:35,300 --> 00:19:36,557
Someone's gaining weight?

360
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:37,470
Me?

361
00:19:37,553 --> 00:19:38,383
Is that what you're saying?

362
00:19:38,466 --> 00:19:40,577
I'm in the middle of
a bulking phase, dude!

363
00:19:40,660 --> 00:19:41,600
Fat, Boxo!

364
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:44,417
It's against the law to talk
about a girl's weight, got it?

365
00:19:44,500 --> 00:19:45,380
Hello there!

366
00:19:46,320 --> 00:19:48,140
The road trip went smoothly.

367
00:19:48,380 --> 00:19:50,377
No accidents or illegal fat comments.

368
00:19:50,460 --> 00:19:52,397
To speak of it, only took us a few days.

369
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:54,737
This contraption sure is handy.

370
00:19:54,820 --> 00:19:57,777
I can see things in the far
off distance clear as day.

371
00:19:57,860 --> 00:20:01,137
Don't forget to revel
in the glory of vending.

372
00:20:01,220 --> 00:20:03,397
Oh dear, gramps.

373
00:20:03,480 --> 00:20:04,797
No need to shout.

374
00:20:04,880 --> 00:20:05,837
I'm right behind you.

375
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:09,077
Up ahead, there's a standoff
against a horde of monsters.

376
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:10,097
Are you sure?

377
00:20:10,180 --> 00:20:11,377
Let me have a gander.

378
00:20:11,460 --> 00:20:13,337
It's serious.

379
00:20:13,420 --> 00:20:15,717
I'm not loving their odds.

380
00:20:15,800 --> 00:20:16,837
The poor saps are.

381
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:17,750
They're outnumbered.

382
00:20:17,833 --> 00:20:20,457
If they're way out here, does
that mean what I think it does?

383
00:20:20,540 --> 00:20:23,716
Hulemy, head right and make
this thing go even faster.

384
00:20:24,020 --> 00:20:25,840
Got it, it'll be my pleasure.

385
00:20:28,640 --> 00:20:30,360
This is all kinds of bad.

386
00:20:30,540 --> 00:20:32,137
They're completely surrounded.

387
00:20:32,220 --> 00:20:33,957
With them packed so tightly together,

388
00:20:34,040 --> 00:20:36,137
it would be too dangerous
to try a magic strike.

389
00:20:36,220 --> 00:20:38,237
Pretty sure we'd ride a set of two.

390
00:20:38,320 --> 00:20:41,257
Oh, Shimei Lion Director Scorching
can't push the win button?

391
00:20:41,340 --> 00:20:44,137
I should probably tell Hulemy
to find somewhere safe to park.

392
00:20:44,220 --> 00:20:46,514
All right, hold on to your butts, guys.

393
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:48,400
Hey, move it over here!

394
00:20:48,660 --> 00:20:49,780
I tried to warn ya.

395
00:20:51,780 --> 00:20:53,440
I knew we'd find them here.

396
00:20:53,580 --> 00:20:56,237
I should've known you'd show
up just in the nick of time.

397
00:20:56,320 --> 00:20:59,379
Hurry, let's move the wounded
inside Boxo's barrier.

398
00:20:59,600 --> 00:21:02,557
If you could still move, carry
somebody who can't inside.

399
00:21:02,640 --> 00:21:04,137
Don't worry, they're the good guys.

400
00:21:04,220 --> 00:21:05,740
You're a lifesaver, Boxo.

401
00:21:06,160 --> 00:21:08,777
You'll be okay, I'll get
you healed up in a jiffy.

402
00:21:08,860 --> 00:21:09,780
Thanks a bunch.

403
00:21:10,240 --> 00:21:11,820
Kai, proceed with caution.

404
00:21:12,040 --> 00:21:13,275
You as well, big sis.

405
00:21:14,500 --> 00:21:15,940
Too hot to handle!

406
00:21:20,040 --> 00:21:20,870
Big bong!

407
00:21:21,280 --> 00:21:24,697
Watching my friends commit acts of
violence reminds me how lucky I am.

408
00:21:24,780 --> 00:21:26,956
They're OP compared to other hunters.

409
00:21:27,620 --> 00:21:30,117
Looks like I don't need
to bust out my arrows.

410
00:21:30,200 --> 00:21:32,617
She's not wrong, but she's also not right.

411
00:21:32,700 --> 00:21:34,818
Time to put that lazy tushy to work.

412
00:21:35,840 --> 00:21:38,760
How do you gotta be so mean, Boxo? Chewy,

413
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:41,297
didn't I teach you if you
have time to run your mouth,

414
00:21:41,380 --> 00:21:42,657
you have time to pull your weight?

415
00:21:42,740 --> 00:21:44,400
I know, you said it a lot!

416
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:48,038
Huh, is it just me or a Shui
frightened of something?

417
00:21:48,480 --> 00:21:50,421
Eh, I should stop dwelling on it.

418
00:21:51,320 --> 00:21:53,460
Thus, the battle ended in victory.

419
00:21:53,700 --> 00:21:56,657
Thanks to my friends laying the
smackdown on those jabronis,

420
00:21:56,740 --> 00:21:59,580
the final battle is almost upon us.

421
00:22:00,280 --> 00:22:02,380
Hey, Boxxo, I could use a drink.

422
00:22:03,060 --> 00:22:03,960
Hello there.

423
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:15,800
The story is.

424
00:22:24,720 --> 00:22:28,400
It's beautiful, beautiful,
beautiful, beautiful.

425
00:22:31,700 --> 00:22:33,337
It's beautiful, beautiful, beautiful.

426
00:22:36,400 --> 00:22:42,420
You don't care about it.

427
00:22:55,180 --> 00:22:56,010
Thank

428
00:22:56,093 --> 00:22:56,923
you

429
00:22:57,006 --> 00:23:02,260
so

430
00:23:12,320 --> 00:23:13,379
much for watching.

431
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:37,680
I look forward to serving you again!
